    "chunk_text": "\u00e6\u00f0 Ga on neorxnawang myd \u00feysum tacne. & gif se engel \u00fee ys hyrde to neorxnawanges geate \u00f0e inganges forwyrne \u00e6tyw hym \u00feysse rode tacen And ic \u00fea \u00f0am engle \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6r hyrde w\u00e6s eall hym swa as\u00e6de. & he me sona ingel\u00e6dde on \u00fea swy\u00f0ran healfe neorxnawanges geates. & he me geanbydian het & me to cw\u00e6\u00f0, Geanbyda her o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t inga eall mennisc cynn \u00fee se f\u00e6der Ac \u00f0a ealle heah f\u00e6deras & \u00fea wytegan \u00fea hig gehyrdon ealle \u00fe\u00e6s scea\u00f0an word \u00fea cw\u00e6don hig ealle He andswarode & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Amen. \u00d0ys syndon \u00fea godcundan & \u00fea halgan gerynu \u00fee \u00f0a twegen wytegan Carinus & Leuticus to so\u00f0on & \u00fea hig eall \u00feys gewryten & gefylled h\u00e6fdon hig up aryson & \u00fea cartan \u00fee hig gewryten h\u00e6fdon \u00feam Carinus his cartan ageaf Annan & Caiphan & Gamaliele. And gelice Leuticus his cartan ageaf Nychodeme & Iosepe & heom \u00feus to cw\u00e6don. Sybb sig myd eow eallum fram \u00feam sylfan Dryhtne H\u00e6lendum Cryste & fram ure ealra H\u00e6lende. And Carinus & Leuticus w\u00e6ron \u00fea f\u00e6ringa swa f\u00e6geres hywes swa seo sunne \u00feonne he beorhtost & on \u00fe\u00e6re beortnysse hyg of \u00feam folce gewyton swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s folces nawyht nyston hw\u00e6der hig foron. Ac \u00fea ealdras \u00fea & \u00fea m\u00e6ssepreostas \u00fea gewrytu r\u00e6ddon \u00fee Carinus & Leuticus",
